d a glass of champagne. Just the way it's supposed to be.<\/p>","text_font":"open_sans_n4","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_alignment":"left","text_size":14,"columns":1,"button_label":"","button_link":"","button_alignment":"center","button_background":"#eeeeee","button_text":"#000000","button_style":"button--primary","background":"#ffffff","gradient":"#ffffff","gradient_rotation":0,"width":"wide","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":20,"padding_left":0,"padding_right":0,"animation":"none","id_sec":"","css_class":"","custom_css":".rich-text__text.content p{\n    max-width:846px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}"}},"a0acd91f-cc30-45d9-b642-50ac5fcbe6ac":{"type":"index__rich-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"","heading_font":"playfair_display_n4","heading_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","heading_alignment":"center","heading_size":30,"text":"<p>MiaDonna was founded in 2005 with a single objective: <br\/><br\/><em>To offer consumers\u00a0beautiful, ethical, and affordable diamonds\u00a0that would help free innocent families oppressed by the active conflict diamond mining industry.<\/em><\/p><p><br\/>That was the birth of the lab-grown diamond industry.<\/p>","text_font":"playfair_display_n4","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_alignment":"center","text_size":26,"columns":1,"button_label":"","button_link":"","button_alignment":"center","button_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_text":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_style":"button--primary","background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","gradient":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","gradient_rotation":180,"width":"wide","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":20,"padding_left":0,"padding_right":0,"animation":"none","id_sec":"","css_class":"","custom_css":""}},"index_video_f6NajT":{"type":"index__video","disabled":true,"settings":{"aspect_ratio":"16:9","autoplay":false,"autoloop":true,"mute_video":false,"controls":true,"iframe_video":"","html5_video":"https:\/\/scdn.speedsize.com\/d9acbe11-c0cc-4d19-a1ce-748a0fd38b05\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/cd1c47b3620a4cee99b35b9d3884553a.mp4","pretext":"","title":"","subtitle":"","pretext_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","heading_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","subheading_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","horizontal_text_position":"center","vertical_text_position":"center","text_align":"center","button_label":"","button_style":"button--secondary","overlay_style":"none","video_overlay_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","gradient":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","gradient_rotation":180,"background_opacity":77,"text_width":70,"mobile_text_below_video":true,"pretext_color_mobile":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","heading_color_mobile":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","subheading_color_mobile":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","width":"standard","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40,"padding_left":0,"padding_right":0,"animation":"none","css_class":"","custom_css":""}},"0503c1a0-b457-45f4-be09-d0c5c74c7eea":{"type":"icon-card","blocks":{"c1d13f08-65b9-43cc-a254-6248d160bb62":{"type":"card","settings":{"title":"","sub_title":"TOP 1% SUSTAINABLE MATERIALS","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MiaDonna-The-Story-Icons_Diamond-web.png","card_info":"We only sell the Top 1% of Lab-Grown Diamonds and Gemstones, ensuring both quality, brilliance, and sustainability. Every setting is handcrafted. using the finest grade recycled of solid gold or platinum.","link_title":"","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/pages\/lab-grown-diamonds"}},"40ffcd00-36bd-415b-bf58-4fe3aae4a3a5":{"type":"card","settings":{"title":"","sub_title":"GIVES BACK 10% PROFITS","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MiaDonna-The-Story-Icons_Give-Back-hi.png","card_info":"MiaDonna is a foundation-first company that gives at least 10% net profits to rebuild and repair the land and lives devastated by the diamond mining industry. We do this through our foundation, The Greener Diamond.","link_title":"Learn More","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/pages\/the-greener-diamond"}},"9b6bd637-353f-4ded-9ecd-085fa75e0bae":{"type":"card","settings":{"title":"","sub_title":"PROTECTS THE EARTH","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MiaDonna-The-Story-Icons_Protect-the-Earth-hi.png","card_info":"We save thousands of tons in natural resources by not mining for diamonds and new gold for our jewelry. We boast a short supply chain and offset carbon emissions required for the minimal shipping by planting a tree for every order.","link_title":"Learn More","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/pages\/our-pledge"}},"c882b7a6-3cda-4516-b472-f38a95b576bf":{"type":"card","settings":{"title":"","sub_title":"ADVOCATES FOR YOU","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MiaDonna-The-Story-Icons_By-Consumers-hi.png","card_info":"We love fine jewelry too! We are consumer advocates, offering luxury jewelry for attainable prices, with endless customization options, easy returns and financing options, free domestic shipping, and world class support from our jewelry experts.","link_title":"Learn More","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/pages\/reviews"}},"c2b0a61a-9de7-44c8-8737-9393178513c1":{"type":"card","settings":{"title":"","sub_title":"FEMALE FOUNDED","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/women-founded-led_085cdda5-0cf7-49b5-9694-fe8997a1098f.png","card_info":"We were founded by a mother who wanted to use the power of diamonds to repair, protect, and empower disenfranchised communities. We're proudly led by a team of strong, altruistic women.","link_title":"Learn More","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/pages\/the-founder"}},"d1f075f1-a472-4a4a-a2a6-95208d4748f3":{"type":"card","settings":{"title":"","sub_title":"B CORP CERTIFIED 83.3 PTS","icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MiaDonna-The-Story-Icons_B-Corp-web.png","card_info":"As the first B Corp-certified diamond retailer, we continue to meet the highest standards of social and environmental impact. We measure more than profit, and use business as a force for good.","link_title":"","learn_more_link":"https:\/\/www.miadonna.com\/blogs\/news\/miadonna-becomes-the-first-b-corp-certified-lab-grown-diamond-company"}}},"block_order":["c1d13f08-65b9-43cc-a254-6248d160bb62","40ffcd00-36bd-415b-bf58-4fe3aae4a3a5","9b6bd637-353f-4ded-9ecd-085fa75e0bae","c882b7a6-3cda-4516-b472-f38a95b576bf","c2b0a61a-9de7-44c8-8737-9393178513c1","d1f075f1-a472-4a4a-a2a6-95208d4748f3"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"The MiaDonna Difference","card_per_row":3,"show_gutter":true,"background_color":"#ffffff","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":40,"css_class":"","custom_css":""}},"ffe6e242-6551-4e5d-a37d-abf980cf1a3f":{"type":"index__image-with-text","blocks":{"56f080f5-58a8-41d2-b2b1-ee74d6127251":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"OUR STORY","pre-title":"","heading_size":"small","text":"<p>MiaDonna began with a simple yet powerful idea: to re-imagine diamonds for the modern world through innovation, integrity and impact.<br\/><br\/>MiaDonna was one of the first to offer lab grown diamonds at scale as a true pioneer. <br\/><br\/>Since 2005, our commitment has been to craft pieces that celebrate beauty, honor responsible innovation, and hold meaning for generations to come.<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}},"61b82b63-0ddb-474a-b218-26dc3f8a74ed":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block_c9308ffb-328d-440a-b5ce-2483822515c8.jpg","image_link":"","image_text":""}}},"block_order":["56f080f5-58a8-41d2-b2b1-ee74d6127251","61b82b63-0ddb-474a-b218-26dc3f8a74ed"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"width":"wide","show_gutter":true,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":80,"animation":"none","id_sec":"","css_class":"section-one-half","custom_css":""}},"f8bea500-5c0d-4262-a369-703910dfb1d4":{"type":"index__image-with-text","blocks":{"template--15035832991823__f8bea500-5c0d-4262-a369-703910dfb1d4-image-1":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block2.jpg","image_link":"","image_text":""}},"template--15035832991823__f8bea500-5c0d-4262-a369-703910dfb1d4-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"OUR MISSION","pre-title":"","heading_size":"small","text":"<p>To celebrate life\u2019s most meaningful moments with beautifully crafted lab-grown diamond jewelry.<br\/><br\/>\u2028We blend modern elegance with responsible innovation to make luxury more accessible \u2014 offering timeless pieces that honor your story today, and for years to come.<br\/><br\/><br\/><\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}}},"block_order":["template--15035832991823__f8bea500-5c0d-4262-a369-703910dfb1d4-image-1","template--15035832991823__f8bea500-5c0d-4262-a369-703910dfb1d4-text-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"width":"wide","show_gutter":true,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":20,"animation":"none","id_sec":"","css_class":"section-one-half more-space","custom_css":""}},"32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe51":{"type":"index__image-with-text","blocks":{"template--15035832991823__32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe51-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"ETHICAL JEWELRY","pre-title":"","heading_size":"small","text":"<p>Brilliance without compromise.<br\/><br\/>Every diamond we offer is lab-grown, a beautiful, modern alternative crafted with integrity and care. Our metals are primarily recycled, and our practices reflect a commitment to quality and conscience. It\u2019s jewelry you can feel confident wearing, made to reflect both your values and your style.<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}},"template--15035832991823__32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe51-image-1":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block3.jpg","image_link":"","image_text":""}}},"block_order":["template--15035832991823__32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe51-text-1","template--15035832991823__32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe51-image-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"width":"wide","show_gutter":true,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":20,"animation":"none","id_sec":"","css_class":"section-one-half more-space","custom_css":""}},"index_image_with_text_qf6rc8":{"type":"index__image-with-text","blocks":{"image_Pmyr33":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Promo_Block4.jpg","image_link":"","image_text":""}},"text_7G7DFn":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"OUR PROMISE TO YOU","pre-title":"","heading_size":"small","text":"<p>Exceptional quality, intentional design, and a personalized experience.<br\/><br\/>From the first glance to the final polish, our pieces are made to last, thoughtfully crafted with high-quality materials, refined settings, and timeless appeal.<br\/><br\/>We\u2019re here to help you celebrate what matters most, with jewelry that feels as special as the moments you wear it for.<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"left","vertical_position":"center"}}},"block_order":["image_Pmyr33","text_7G7DFn"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"width":"wide","show_gutter":true,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":50,"animation":"none","id_sec":"","css_class":"section-one-half more-space","custom_css":""}},"index_image_with_text_2_Qg4qPX":{"type":"index__image-with-text-2","blocks":{"text_YmTDtM":{"type":"text","settings":{"heading_tag":"h2","title":"MAKE IT PERSONAL","title2":"","text":"<p>Reserve a dedicated hour with one of our jewelry specialists at our Bridgeport Village flagship, where exceptional quality, ethical diamonds, and one-on-one attention come standard. Browse loose stones, dream up a custom design, and enjoy a glass of champagne while you're at it. The way fine jewelry shopping is supposed to be.<\/p>","button_label":"Book Appointment","link":"#","button_style":"button--secondary","open_new_new_tab_button_1_ink":false,"button_label2":"","link2